Subject: [PATCH 13/13] dt-bindings: iio: health: Add MAX30105 support to max30102.txt
Date: Fri, 27 Oct 2017 21:29:53 +0200
Message-Id: <1509132593-1815-19-git-send-email-pmeerw@pmeerw.net>
In-Reply-To: <1509132593-1815-1-git-send-email-pmeerw@pmeerw.net>
